WEBVTT

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:03.640
My passionate idol activities,

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:07.210
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:10.360
So far on Aikatsu!

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:16.080
I'm Hoshimiya Ichigo, a third-year middle-schooler at the idol school Starlight Academy.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:19.540
We use Aikatsu cards to perform our idol activities.

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:24.040
Ever since I met Otoshiro Seira-chan from the new school Dream Academy

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:27.040
and her producer, Saegusa Kii-chan,

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:30.180
my Aikatsu has gotten more passionate than ever.

00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:43.060
I read you loud and clear!

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:45.600
I haven't said anything yet.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:51.320
I, Johnny Bepp, know what the Academy Mother wants to say before she says it!

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:53.110
Leave it all to me.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.490
Do me proud.

00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:57.570
Yes, ma'am.

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:03.470
And what she wants is...

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:05.000
Prophos!

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:09.630
When you're all sweaty after one of my lessons,

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:13.740
just use Prophos soap and you'll smell like flowers!

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:16.260
Wait, wrong!

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:19.110
I'm not here to talk about soap!

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:26.170
I'm talking about promotional photos!

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:30.770
They're an important part of selling yourself as an idol.

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:34.100
And so, my honeys,

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:37.280
we're gonna be taking new promo photos for all of you!

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:38.500
Wow!

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:39.280
Yay!

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:43.920
And here's the new camera I just bought!

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:47.540
Its very first picture will be all my honeys' smiles.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:49.920
Now, say "Johnny"!

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:51.960
Johnny...

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:35.090
Good job, Ran-chan. You're doing great.

00:03:35.090 --> 00:03:37.530
Let's go with "cool" for the next one.

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:38.030
Alright.

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:43.160
Okay, that's it!

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:46.720
Ran's gotten really good at posing for pictures.

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:48.040
Naturally!

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.800
While you were in America,

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:54.540
Ran-tan became Spicy Ageha's muse!

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:57.100
In the two years since we became idols,

00:03:57.100 --> 00:04:00.050
we've mostly gotten used to getting our pictures taken,

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:02.930
but promotional photographs are a big deal.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:04.300
We have to give it all we've got!

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:09.180
Otome wants hers to be all Powa Powa and Puririn too! {punctuate and stuff as you wish}

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:10.830
Ahem.

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:15.060
It's time for How To Look Nice In Pictures 101! {go ahead and change everything here if you want}{mmm, but... quotes? itals?}

00:04:15.410 --> 00:04:16.570
Professor Aoi!

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:18.190
Teach us!

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:21.400
As long as you remember the following three things, {why not points?}

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:24.080
you'll look great in any photo.

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:26.490
As idols, you should know all this already,

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:28.290
but let's go over it anyway.

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:29.200
Okay!

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:30.790
The first thing to keep in mind:

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:34.600
In order to get the perfect angle and expression,

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:39.710
you should practice in front of a mirror and take your own photos.

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:43.220
Okay!

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:48.870
The perfect pose is one where you look not tense, but at ease.

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:54.660
Now for number two:

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:56.760
Never forget your smile!

00:04:56.760 --> 00:04:58.980
Pay special attention to the angle of your lips.

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:02.530
Raising the corners of your mouth helps to achieve this.

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:08.660
One helpful thing to do is to recite "a-i-u-e-o" to soften up your cheeks before a photoshoot.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:14.120
A-i-u-e-o... {.......}

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:14.720
And finally,

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:16.700
the third key point:

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:20.560
No matter how well your lips smile, if your eyes are spacing out, it all amounts to nothing!

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:22.270
Nothing!

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:28.530
It's common knowledge that thinking about things you like will cause your eyes to light up.

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:37.120
So just think about a pet you love, an idol you admire, or a song you like and you're all set.

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:41.420
In any case, you need to put your heart into your expression!

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:45.570
Professor Aoi, thank you very much!

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:49.120
Your turn, Ichigo.

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:50.830
Next, Starmiya-honey.

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:52.040
Ah, okay!

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.760
Let's standby!

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:55.520
Okay.

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:56.740
Photograph me well.

00:05:56.740 --> 00:05:58.330
I'll do my best.

00:05:58.330 --> 00:06:00.090
It's Orihime.

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:00.840
Yes.

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:03.340
Ichigo-chan, that's great!

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:07.840
Okay.

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:12.850
You're saying you want to use one of my idols to promote a new camera model?

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:15.420
Sounds like fun!

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:16.350
Huh?

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:18.850
With Starlight Academy?

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:25.020
"Took some new promotional photos today."

00:06:27.560 --> 00:06:29.950
Ooh, a response already.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:34.990
My heart will jump an octave higher!

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.760
I loved that expression she had. {something about the tenses rubbed me the wrong way}

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:44.000
I wonder if Seira-chan practices in front of a mirror.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.500
She definitely does.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:48.130
There's also her producer, Saegusa Kii-chan.

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:51.260
I'm sure her advice helps a lot. {stupid unclear personal pronouns}

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:52.420
You're right.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:53.510
Alright!

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:56.140
We can't let her look better than us!

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:02.770
Say John-ny.

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:05.050
John-ny...

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:07.200
Good!

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:08.410
Um...

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:10.090
What did you want to talk about?

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:11.160
Photo session!

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:19.670
A request for you three to help promote this new camera has come in.

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:22.420
We're going to let fans take pictures of you with this camera.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:26.240
We'll also be holding a photo contest.

00:07:26.240 --> 00:07:29.170
So the fans will be the ones taking pictures of us?

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:36.270
Yes. We want to show them that not just pros, but anyone can capture brilliant smiles with this camera. {rohdruhiovnerosfnms}

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:37.670
Sounds interesting!

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:40.350
Are we the only ones taking part?

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.310
There's one more person.

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:46.320
Dream Academy's Otoshiro Seira's going to participate too.

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:48.420
Seira-chan too?

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:49.860
DreAca...

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:57.740
The world is eager to see whether it's 
Starlight Academy or Dream Academy

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:00.290
that ends up at the top.

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:01.330
I see.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:04.870
We'll be compared no matter what we do.

00:08:04.870 --> 00:08:07.030
This photo session is no exception.

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:10.550
This is the face of rivalry.

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:15.440
It's up to you whether you want to participate.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:18.350
I want to do it with her!

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:19.880
Ichigo...

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:24.200
I'm sure Seira-chan knows about a lot of stuff I don't!

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:24.970
Yeah!

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:26.480
Especially about rock.

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:31.590
And Kii-chan's data-analyzing power is really something special. {I think I'm tired of using this already}

00:08:31.590 --> 00:08:36.870
So if we all Aikatsu together, we can all become better idols!

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.560
Sounds good to me.

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:39.240
Me too!

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:42.280
So should I tell them you'll do it?

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:43.000
Yes!

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:46.210
It's been a while since you three had a gig together.

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:51.280
Here's this year's school dress.

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:53.690
Hoshimiya, you don't have yours yet, right? {why didn't you give it to her when you gave her the new phone}{dramatic tension}

00:08:53.690 --> 00:08:54.220
I don't.

00:08:54.610 --> 00:08:56.220
Thank you very much!

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:02.220
It's been so long since we stood on stage together!

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:03.750
I'm so excited!

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:04.850
I can hardly wait.

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:11.240
Looks like Hoshimiya met lots of people on her journey and learned a lot of things.

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:12.120
Yes.

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:14.240
Now that she can absorb power from her rivals,

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:17.240
I can't wait to see what kind of idol she'll become.

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:19.490
I'm looking forward to it.

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:28.110
The promotional power of the upcoming photo session is super interesting.

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:33.750
"Aha, so it's come to this", and all that.

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:36.990
As a producer, I'm learning so much from my findings,

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:39.640
like what's like what and where it all is! {arghiojdognmosernmgodnthosermkogndmotnmoegjsoejrgkotnd}

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:42.140
Here you go.

00:09:47.110 --> 00:09:50.330
Brain Thunder, fight and boom!

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:53.580
Kii, give me the details about the photo session.

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:55.150
Ok-ok-okay!

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:05.170
People chosen by a fair, balanced, and completely unrigged lottery

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:08.540
will use this camera to take pictures of you as if you were at a photoshoot.

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:09.790
Oh.

00:10:10.180 --> 00:10:13.920
Once everyone gets their hands on the camera, they'll understand how good it is!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:17.080
And there'll be an idol-shooting photo contest too!

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:20.080
It's mega good promotional material!

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:21.050
Yeah.

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:24.210
I know you just became an idol,

00:10:24.210 --> 00:10:29.310
but as your producer, I'm here to bring you the best smile, the best facial expression,

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:30.560
and even the ideal angle for your lips!

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:36.120
But still, I don't think that'll be quite enough this time.

00:10:36.790 --> 00:10:38.820
What makes you think that?

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:41.870
About that, well, frankly...

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:43.580
Candidness?

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:45.410
Right.

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:49.460
What we need to aim for in this photo session is, honestly,

00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:50.960
candidness!

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:54.690
I don't remember eating candy... {this is the best I can do}

00:10:54.690 --> 00:10:56.310
And I don't remember giving you any! {Have you got corn for ears?}

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:58.440
No, you see...

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:01.140
When I say "candidness", I mean things like...

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:03.260
"Killer shot! Groggy-eyed Ichigo!"

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:04.890
When did you take that?

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:06.600
This one I call "Blushing Ran".

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:07.890
Delete it!

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:10.850
Sorry, I can't. It's one of my treasures.

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:13.620
I can't believe I made a face like that.

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:15.510
It's not like you can always see yourself.

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:16.240
That's right.

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:20.860
Candidness occurs when something happens unintentionally or outside of your expectations.

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:25.370
I was thinking that the fans would want to take pictures like that.

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:26.710
I see.

00:11:27.230 --> 00:11:30.610
If they got shots like yours, the fans would be delighted!

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:32.000
Way to go, Aoi!

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:36.920
But the whole point is that you can't do it intentionally.

00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:40.840
I know!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:41.930
Let's go!

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:42.760
Huh? {Aoi != Ran}

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:43.590
Where?

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:45.890
Time's a-wasting!

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:48.930
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:04.600
Ready? Here we go!

00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:06.870
Say John-ny!

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:08.870
John-ny...

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:13.560
Let's see how they turned out.

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:15.380
Huh?

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:19.860
Our eyes are huge.

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:22.730
This machine has some weird special effects.

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:24.230
They're so funny!

00:12:24.230 --> 00:12:25.110
But...

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:27.720
No, that expression won't do at all!

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:29.390
Huh? That voice...

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:34.100
Seira-chan, Kii-chan!

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:36.230
Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:37.700
Hello!

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:39.270
No way no way no way!

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:42.280
Kiriya Aoi-chan and Shibuki Ran-chan are with you too!

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.690
What are you two doing here?

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:46.780
Probably the same thing as us. {as we, technically}

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:48.740
Probably.

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:54.560
Are these really necessary?

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:57.500
Idols have to disguise themselves when they're out in public.

00:12:57.840 --> 00:13:03.470
If people saw the rising star Otoshiro Seira walking around on the street, there'd be a big ruckus.

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:05.300
I see.

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:08.290
So why are we all walking together?

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:11.850
The purikura photos you just took were for the upcoming photo session, right?

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:13.290
Of course!

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:16.830
We were doing research on candid expressions

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:20.110
so that we can make our fans as happy as possible!

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:22.230
Let's come up with ideas together!

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:26.490
Your voice echoed really nicely just now.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:27.700
Really?

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:30.010
But,

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:33.000
since DreAca and Starlight are rivals,

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:37.840
I feel like we're probably not supposed to be working together like this...

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.000
Don't mind that.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:40.250
Seira?

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:44.960
The more data we have, the easier it'll be to find the answers we're looking for.

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:46.510
Yeah, you're right.

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:56.230
We'll try all sorts of things...

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:04.410
...and find out what candid expressions we make.

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:08.240
Let's uncover all, all, all of them!

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:11.240
Show me those pearly whites! {sup, ED reference}

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:13.480
I think we've taken enough.

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:15.160
Let's take a break.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:16.210
Agreed!

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:18.710
I know a good place.

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:24.590
Yay! Ichigo-chan's here again!

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:26.530
Aren't you lucky, Noelle?

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:27.050
Yeah!

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:29.540
So this is Seira-chan's house.

00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:30.090
Yeah.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.260
This is my first time too!

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:34.560
Ah, it's so nice!

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:35.610
It is.

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.640
So you've been here before, Ichigo?

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:39.560
I came with Raichi the other day. {last week}

00:14:40.210 --> 00:14:43.330
Onee-chan, you've been to Ichigo-chan's house before, right?

00:14:43.330 --> 00:14:45.070
Yeah, I had a seaweed bento there.

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:46.570
Wasn't it good?

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:47.630
It was.

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:50.650
And her mom had this "la-la-la" aura about her.

00:14:50.650 --> 00:14:51.450
Like her daughter.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:52.420
Like me?

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:53.870
It's the way your voices echo.

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:55.710
You think so?

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:57.370
Thanks for waiting!

00:14:57.900 --> 00:15:00.870
Three strawberry parfaits and two Brain Thunders.

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:02.260
Thanks, Papa.

00:15:02.260 --> 00:15:04.190
Thank you very much!

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:06.880
It's like I just got four new daughters!

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:08.760
It makes my heart pound! {pirate?}

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:11.410
Papa, just leave them alone.

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:13.390
Noelle, come help out too.

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:14.650
Okay.

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:22.230
Hey, what's "Brain Thunder"?

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:24.720
It's my favorite Aikatsu drink.

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:26.370
Brain Thunder!

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:29.780
It gives you a shot in the arm and a boost to your brain!

00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:33.050
Time to eat! {...}

00:15:36.860 --> 00:15:38.540
I'm in heaven!

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:39.910
Photo chance!

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:43.790
This one is your best shot so far.

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:46.710
Look.

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:47.770
You're right.

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:48.520
Here.

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:50.090
She looks great.

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:51.030
Really?

00:15:51.030 --> 00:15:53.050
Don't I look really sloppy?

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:55.620
That's the candidness I was talking about.

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:58.220
Look, this one is Seira's "best shot".

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:04.060
You can feel Seira's love for music shine through.

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:05.320
Her face is so gentle.

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:06.070
Yeah.

00:16:06.070 --> 00:16:09.520
It's really unpredictable for the normally reserved Seira-chan to be like that.

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:10.570
Oh?

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:12.570
Oh!

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:15.910
Hey, can I see the pictures you all took?

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:16.790
Sure.

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:18.080
I want to see!

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:24.070
Oh, I see.

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:25.710
I understand now!

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:26.710
Right?

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:30.590
Our best faces appear when we're doing what we love!

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:31.590
Yeah!

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:33.050
That's right!

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:35.660
My hearts starts fluttering when I eat a parfait.

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:38.770
As long as we can set our hearts aflutter,

00:16:38.770 --> 00:16:41.980
the fans that come to our photoshoot will definitely have a good time.

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:43.100
Yeah!

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:46.820
Ichigo, there's cream on your nose.

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:48.040
What?

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:51.110
That's impossible, you know...

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:53.580
But it's such a waste!

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:57.210
I'll give you a bite of my cream.

00:16:57.210 --> 00:16:58.120
Yay!

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:00.120
Thank you so much, Aoi!

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:05.180
I love that smile.

00:17:05.180 --> 00:17:06.000
Oh yeah.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:08.840
Maybe we should eat parfaits at the photo session.

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:11.040
You just want an excuse to eat more.

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:12.760
Then maybe you can have seaweed, Ran.

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:19.640
That'd be something <i>really</i> special.

00:17:19.640 --> 00:17:21.830
Cut that out already...

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:26.890
Your notes ring in unison.

00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:28.650
The harmony is like a canon.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:29.360
Huh?

00:17:29.700 --> 00:17:34.600
She's saying that the three of you show your best faces when you're with each other!

00:17:34.600 --> 00:17:35.470
Right?

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:41.160
I can't wait to stand on stage with you two!

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:42.220
Me neither.

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:43.660
It can't come soon enough.

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:46.160
Aikatsu is great, isn't it? {ISN'T IT}

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:49.420
I even got to do Aikatsu with
 Seira-chan and Kii-chan today.

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:52.920
I had a ton of fun today!

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:55.090
Yeah.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:56.880
I had lots of fun too!

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:05.210
We can finally go on stage together again.

00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:06.470
It's been so long.

00:18:06.470 --> 00:18:07.860
A whole year, in fact.

00:18:07.860 --> 00:18:11.940
I'm <i>super</i> happy to be on stage with you two again! {I think I like this word too much}

00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:14.320
Today's another day of idol activities!

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:15.320
Let's go get'em!

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:16.470
Yeah!

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:23.450
May the fluttering of our hearts reach everyone today! {arijubgdrineiosngfjiodrnhisernjgfse}{either is fine}

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:30.140
Ah, that was fun!

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:31.390
We really set them aflutter.

00:21:31.740 --> 00:21:34.090
They all looked like they had so much fun!

00:21:34.090 --> 00:21:36.680
Nothing beats being on stage with you two.

00:21:36.680 --> 00:21:37.530
Yeah!

00:21:39.590 --> 00:21:40.780
Seira-chan!

00:21:40.780 --> 00:21:42.780
Your harmony on stage was great.

00:21:43.180 --> 00:21:44.900
It resounded straight through the audience.

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:46.300
Thanks.

00:21:46.300 --> 00:21:48.280
You're up next, right?

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:51.910
The training we've done at DreAca is something fierce, you know!

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:53.200
It is.

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:54.910
Good luck, then.

00:21:54.910 --> 00:21:55.630
Thanks.

00:22:05.370 --> 00:22:09.680
Maybe it would be nice to stand on stage with friends...

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:10.700
Seira?

00:22:11.810 --> 00:22:13.450
To the stage!

00:22:14.900 --> 00:22:16.810
Knock'em out!

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:57.700
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism.

00:23:58.790 --> 00:24:03.220
They say that anyone can use this new camera to take good pictures.

00:24:03.220 --> 00:24:05.310
Beautiful people turn even more beautiful,

00:24:05.310 --> 00:24:07.260
and those who aren't get a boost too.

00:24:08.050 --> 00:24:09.840
Let your true self shine through.

00:24:10.710 --> 00:24:11.510
Cute...

00:24:11.510 --> 00:24:12.010
Who?

00:24:12.010 --> 00:24:15.430
Kii, why don't you give the Pon Pon Crepe audition a try? {NO DON'T YOU DARE PON PON CREPE IS AOI'S YOU BITCH}

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:17.470
I'm a producer, not an idol, you know.

00:24:17.930 --> 00:24:19.640
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.640 --> 00:24:21.480
Our Catchphrase is Ok-Ok-Okay!

00:24:21.480 --> 00:24:24.960
Always passionate, idol activities!
